{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 50 fast-paced levels and train your <strong>Soul Reflex</strong> in a high-speed, Rhythm-Action 3D Runner centered on a journey toward Spiritual Awakening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try, try, and try again as you visualize your mind's state and practice reaction time. Every run is a reflection of your focus, presence, and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the flow, transcend the limits of the physical, and chase the Light to awaken your true potential. This is a challenge of precision, flow, and self-mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 Neon-Drenched Hand Crafted Levels:</strong> A massive challenge to test your limits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Speed Hazards:</strong> Maintain your flow while dodging Red Lasers, Falling Floors, and shifting geometry. Hesitation is failure.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extreme Mobility:</strong> It\u2019s not just double jumps... chain power-ups to perform <strong>Septuple (7x) Jumps</strong> and massive leaps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode:</strong> Once you master the campaign, test your stamina in the procedurally generated &quot;Endless Speed&quot; and &quot;Endless Reflex&quot; maps. How long can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Player Races(Beta)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race side-by-side on 2 dedicated maps (with more coming based on community feedback).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Mode in Development.\u00a0Upcoming support for direct Steam Friend Invites</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Call","path":"https:/