ust double jumps... chain power-ups to perform <strong>Septuple (7x) Jumps</strong> and massive leaps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode:</strong> Once you master the campaign, test your stamina in the procedurally generated &quot;Endless Speed&quot; and &quot;Endless Reflex&quot; maps. How long can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Player Races(Beta)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race side-by-side on 2 dedicated maps (with more coming based on community feedback).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Mode in Development.\u00a0Upcoming support for direct Steam Friend Invites</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["UltimaUnleashed"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158840/37097a80f22f777a20bdbfec4ee40f414457bd43/header.jpg?t=1768284463","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4158840/756145679/3e595aa35e8cbe0526cda20af31396521a247879/1768284073/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768284462","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4158840/756145679/3e595aa35e8cbe0526cda20af31396521a247879/1768284073/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768284462","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4158840/756145679/3e595aa35e8cbe0526cda20af31396521a247879/1768284073/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768284462","id":257263955,"name":"Endless Mode","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s